# Large test/demo models go through Git LFS (plan-360). These three were
# git-ignored and lived only in Plastic, which is why four test suites were red
# in every fresh worktree — git worktrees never received them.
#
# Scoped to these paths on purpose, NOT a blanket "*.glb": 32 other GLBs
# (~198 MB) are already tracked here as plain blobs, and this repo is mirrored
# to the public GitHub remote. A blanket rule would either warn on every public
# clone or force those 198 MB into GitHub LFS, whose free tier allows 1 GB of
# bandwidth per month. Add new large models here explicitly.
public/models/DemoRobotIK.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/models/EuropalletEmpty.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/models/tests.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
